">Custom sizes, colors, and branding available</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1303\">\n<p data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1303\">Supports local artisan communities in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1308\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1344\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1342\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1499\">Looking for a <strong data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1404\">rattan laundry basket supplier in Vietnam</strong>?<br data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1408\" />We welcome OEM &amp; bulk inquiries.<br data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1443\" />📧 <strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1473\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1471\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong><br data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1476\" />🌐 <strong data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1499\"><a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1497\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></strong></p>",
